WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:01.559
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.559 --> 00:00:03.033
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:04.033
On a Thursday, no less!

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:05.234
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.234 --> 00:00:07.100
In a new interview,
President Biden defended

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.934
his handling of the U.S. troop
withdrawal from Afghanistan

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:12.467
and said, "I don't think
it was a failure."

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:13.601
But he said it the same way

00:00:13.601 --> 00:00:15.834
you would compliment
your friend's play.

00:00:15.834 --> 00:00:18.667
I thought it was pretty good!

00:00:18.667 --> 00:00:21.000
[ Laughter ]
Officials from the
Treasury Department

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.300
are reportedly trying
to prevent the Taliban

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.067
from accessing the
International Monetary Fund.

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:27.634
Well, have you tried one
of those things

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:30.000
where they have to click
on all the fire hydrants?

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.334
I can never do 'em.

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:33.267
[ Laughter ]
President Biden
announced yesterday

00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:35.901
that nursing homes
must require their staff

00:00:35.901 --> 00:00:38.400
to be vaccinated
against the coronavirus

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.734
or, more accurately,
President Biden

00:00:40.734 --> 00:00:42.567
announced yesterday
that nursing homes

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:44.901
weren't already doing that?!

00:00:44.901 --> 00:00:46.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.767
The John Lewis
Voting Rights Advancement Act

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:50.234
that Democrats
unveiled this week

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:52.067
is expected to be passed
by the House.

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:54.067
Oh, sure,
it'll get through the House,

00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:56.901
but can it get through Manchin?
["mansion"]

00:00:56.901 --> 00:01:00.634
[ Laughter ]
A rare pun from Baze!

00:01:00.634 --> 00:01:04.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.534 --> 00:01:05.868
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo

00:01:05.868 --> 00:01:08.133
has filed retirement papers
with the state

00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:11.501
so he can receive
his $50,000 annual pension.

00:01:11.501 --> 00:01:13.968
For his part, Cuomo claims
it's not a cash grab,

00:01:13.968 --> 00:01:16.767
but, rather,
a friendly cash embrace.

00:01:16.767 --> 00:01:18.701
[ As Cuomo ]
I'm Italian.

00:01:18.701 --> 00:01:22.133
[ Laughter ]
The new host of "Jeopardy!",
Mike Richards,

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:25.467
apologized yesterday for sexist
comments he made on a podcast.

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:28.133
At this rate, he's going to be
the first "Jeopardy!" host

00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:30.901
to actually invoke
double jeopardy.

00:01:30.901 --> 00:01:33.501
"Objection, I-I already got
in trouble for that one.

00:01:33.501 --> 00:01:35.234
What?
Oh, sorry.

00:01:35.234 --> 00:01:37.100
What is objection?"

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:38.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.734 --> 00:01:40.534
Facebook today launched a test

00:01:40.534 --> 00:01:42.868
of its new virtual reality
remote work app,

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:44.968
where employees
can hold meetings

00:01:44.968 --> 00:01:47.400
using an Oculus Quest 2 headset.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:50.701
It's great, if the only thing
you hate about Zoom meetings is

00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:53.033
that they aren't strapped
to your face.

00:01:53.033 --> 00:01:55.200
[ Laughter ]
A rare photograph

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.734
of women's rights activist
Susan B. Anthony

00:01:57.734 --> 00:02:00.167
is set to go up for auction
next month in New York.

00:02:00.167 --> 00:02:02.334
It's rare
because it's a photo of her

00:02:02.334 --> 00:02:04.901
kissing another girl
to get free drinks.

00:02:04.901 --> 00:02:08.033
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.033 --> 00:02:11.734
Tell people.

00:02:11.734 --> 00:02:13.267
Finally,
according to a new survey,

00:02:13.267 --> 00:02:16.701
70% of Americans would give up
their smartphones for their pets

00:02:16.701 --> 00:02:19.701
and certain pets
make you do that.

00:02:19.701 --> 00:02:21.467
And that, you guys,
was a monologue.

